# Helper-Chan's conversations
msgid "Skip this conversation"
msgstr "Skip this one"

msgid "A place beside yours"
msgstr "Got place beside you"

msgid "The desk is ready. So am I. What should I remind you of when things get difficult?"
msgstr "Desk ready already. Me also ready. When things become jialat, what you want me remind you?"

msgid "Make something I'm proud of"
msgstr "Make something I proud of"

msgid "Reach someone who needs it"
msgstr "Reach somebody who need it"

msgid "The first page worth keeping"
msgstr "First page must keep"

msgid "I kept a copy of the first finished page. Official archival duties, obviously."
msgstr "I keep one copy of the first finished page. Official archive duty, confirm."

msgid "Keep the rough draft too"
msgstr "Rough draft also keep"

msgid "Start with the finished page"
msgstr "Start from finished page first"

msgid "The clipboard has room for a difficult chapter, too. What would help right now?"
msgstr "Clipboard still got space for difficult chapter also. Now what can help you?"

msgid "Talk it through"
msgstr "Talk it out"

msgid "Just stay beside me for a bit"
msgstr "Just stay beside me a while can"

msgid "A pause is allowed. I checked. I'll stay beside you. We don't have to fill the silence."
msgstr "Rest a while can one. I checked already. I stay beside you. No need to talk also can."

msgid "Stay and chat"
msgstr "Stay and chit-chat"

msgid "Desk migration"
msgstr "Shift desk"

msgid "The important equipment survived. Clipboard, glasses, and an unreasonable amount of hair."
msgstr "Important things all survive. Clipboard, spectacles, and the hair, so much until cannot make it."

msgid "How is the archive?"
msgstr "The archive how?"

msgid "How is the new view?"
msgstr "The new view how?"

msgid "Anime, merchandise, a million readers. People will remember these pages. I kept the first one, you know."
msgstr "Anime, merchandise, one million readers. People sure remember these pages. The first one I still keep, you know."

msgid "Let's keep making them"
msgstr "Continue making them"

msgid "Thank you for staying"
msgstr "Thank you for staying with me"
